  "_icon_grammar": "rev 24 — CATEGORY-KEYED shapes: Diamond = currency & currency-kin (currency, fossils, oils, harvest, delirium, sulphur/ducats, wombgifts, tainted) · Square = maps/fragments/div cards · Hexagon = scarabs · Triangle = gems · Raindrop = essences · Kite = corpses · Cross = jewels + safety nets. Star = the one SHARED shape: house-band chase rows only (Mirror-class, 6L/6S, category white-plate tops). ICON FLOOR: icons at R0-R2 only, and the floor reads the PROMISE, not the paint — jewels borrow the rarity-plate grammar (visually rung-4) but pass the R2 test in Ruthless, so they KEEP their Crosses; the footer [99999] emergency keeps 2 White Cross; the net accent stays iconless. Scrolls, tan-band currency, common fossils carry none. RETIRED SHAPES, explicit (request-05 Q2): Circle is RETIRED (rev-23 band grammar superseded by Diamond for currency-kin); UpsideDownHouse and Pentagon are RETIRED (pre-kit). Replace on sight; no shape outside the table is valid.",
