  "_border_convention": "rev 25.2 (request-05 Q1): ABSENT BorderColor = the row yields the border channel to state decorators (corrupted/linked/influenced/fractured/enchanted), same as absent TextColor yields to rarity. Transparent #00000000 = deliberate SUPPRESS (annotated per-row with _border). This patch now omits BorderColor everywhere a state may show through; the only remaining border values are real borders (house/emphasis/band-mark/influence) and annotated suppressors. Influenced rows keep their border: influence is itself a state — if the decorator [11003] covers it, drop the border from these rows and let the decorator own it (preferred; avoids double-speak: decorator 150 0 255 vs kit 150 110 255 — unify on the decorator's value)."
